  "scope": "Source research for independent structural and date adjudication following withdrawal of the collective-reference attestation and sex claim. No approvals.",
  "finding": "In s0254 苻亡 describes the fall of the Fu ruling house. In s0258 the old lord can be identified by the named exhumation account in 116 s0175. That action is posthumous. Jinshu 113 and Tongjian 100 date Fu Jian’s accession as Great Qin Heavenly King to AD 357; Jinshu 114 and Tongjian 106 date his death to AD 385. A reusable structured attestation must separately cite these personal endpoints and the actual local mention; an interval cannot be inferred from s0254. Distinguish 苻堅 from 苻健.",
